  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DanChurchAid - Ukraine Transition Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key objectives within broader reconstruction and mine action are: 

- Ensuring that war-affected communities of Mykolaiv regain access to critical social infrastructure, enabling access to safe learning environments, including WASH facilities, and basic health care through health centres.

- Enabling local civil society as active and capable actors, who engage in and participate in the democratic and transparent recovery process of Mykolaiv Oblast.

- Promoting economic recovery with a focus on the agricultural sector and socially responsible businesses.

- Clearing explosive ordnance from agricultural and critical lands, restoring access to infrastructure and livelihoods. Strengthen local organizations to lead mine action efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
